              Why <%= rec.recommendation.recommendedMaterial %> is Best
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
              Formulated specifically for <span class="text-white font-semibold"><%= rec.commodityName %></span> (<%= rec.commodityType %>)
            </p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal Body -->
      <div class="p-6 space-y-5 text-sm text-slate-700 max-h-[75vh] overflow-y-auto">
        
        <!-- Quick Verdict Card (Plain Human Language) -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-50 via-indigo-50 to-emerald-50 border border-sky-100/80 space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs shrink-0">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider">The Short Answer (In Simple Words)</h4>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            <strong><%= rec.commodityName %></strong> contains <strong><%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.moistureContent) || 0 %>% moisture</strong> and <strong><%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.fatContent) || 0 %>% fat</strong>. Without proper protection, oxygen causes fat to turn rancid while ambient air either dries the food out or turns it soggy. <strong><%= rec.recommendation.recommendedMaterial %></strong> provides the exact barrier needed to lock in freshness for <strong><%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.desiredShelfLifeDays) || 30 %> days</strong> without paying for excessive unnecessary plastic.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 1: Barrier Defense (Oxygen & Moisture Physics) -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-sky-600"></i> 1. Gas & Moisture Barrier Protection
            </h4>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200">Barrier Physics</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-sky-500 me-1"></i> Theory:</span>
            Air molecules (oxygen &amp; water vapor) naturally try to push through packaging to balance concentration. This film acts like a microscopic wall, giving gases almost no tiny openings to squeeze through.
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2 ps-0 list-none mb-0">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-sky-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Oxygen Control (OTR <%= rec.recommendation.barrierRequirements.otr %> cc/m²/day):</strong>
                Restricts incoming oxygen so aerobic bacteria and molds cannot survive or multiply.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-sky-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Moisture Control (WVTR <%= rec.recommendation.barrierRequirements.wvtr %> g/m²/day):</strong>
                <% if (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.moistureContent > 40) { %>
                  Locks natural water inside so the food stays juicy and doesn't shrivel or lose weight.
                <% } else { %>
                  Stops ambient humidity from entering, ensuring dry/crisp snacks stay crunchy instead of going soft.
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-sky-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">MAP Headspace Synergy:</strong>
                Maintains the <%= rec.recommendation.mapGasRatios.co2Pct %>% CO₂ / <%= rec.recommendation.mapGasRatios.o2Pct %>% O₂ / <%= rec.recommendation.mapGasRatios.n2Pct %>% N₂ protective gas mix inside the package throughout transit.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2: Polymer Molecular Structure -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-dna text-indigo-600"></i> 2. Polymer Chemistry & Gauge Strength
            </h4>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200">Polymer Science</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-indigo-500 me-1"></i> Theory:</span>
            Plastics are made of long chain-like molecules. Polymers with tightly packed, crystalline alignments make the gas path extremely winding ("tortuous path"), drastically slowing down permeation.
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2 ps-0 list-none mb-0">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-indigo-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Polymer Base (<%= rec.recommendation.polymerType %>):</strong>
                Chemical structure is inert and will not react with the natural fats, acids (pH <%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.ph) || 7 %>), or aromas of <%= rec.commodityName %>.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-indigo-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Optimized Gauge (<%= rec.recommendation.structuralSpecs.recommendedThicknessMicrons %> µm):</strong>
                Tailored for <%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.packagingType) || 'this packaging format' %> to resist punctures, tearing, and shipping stresses without adding dead weight.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-indigo-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Seal Integrity (<%= rec.recommendation.structuralSpecs.tensileStrengthMpa %> MPa Tensile):</strong>
                Forms an airtight, hermetic thermal weld along package edges that prevents leakages during cold chain or shelf display.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3: Spoilage & Sensory Defense -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-bacteria text-rose-600"></i> 3. Degradation & Spoilage Prevention
            </h4>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200">Freshness Logic</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-rose-500 me-1"></i> Theory:</span>
            Food loses quality when enzymes break down proteins or when fats interact with oxygen (lipid oxidation). Cutting off reactive oxygen stops these chemical cascades in their tracks.
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2 ps-0 list-none mb-0">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-rose-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Stops Rancidity:</strong>
                Protects the <%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.fatContent) || 0 %>% lipid content against free-radical oxidation that produces sour, unpleasant off-flavors.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-rose-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Aroma & Flavor Seal:</strong>
                Traps the volatile aroma compounds inside the packaging so customer aroma experience is fresh upon opening.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-rose-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Extended Market Window:</strong>
                Maintains prime retail quality throughout the targeted <%= (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.desiredShelfLifeDays) || 30 %>-day distribution lifecycle.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 4: Safety & Sustainability -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-emerald-600"></i> 4. Food Safety & Sustainability Rating
            </h4>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200">Compliance & Eco</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-white/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/60 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-emerald-500 me-1"></i> Theory:</span>
            Food packaging must never leach chemicals into consumable products, and modern circular design requires reducing raw material consumption.
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2 ps-0 list-none mb-0">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Certified Food Contact Safe:</strong>
                Fully compliant with FDA 21 CFR regulations and EU Framework Regulation (EC) No 1935/2004 for non-toxic food contact.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Carbon Footprint Saving:</strong>
                Achieves <strong>+<%= rec.recommendation.carbonSavingsPct %>% CO₂ reduction</strong> (Eco Rating <%= rec.recommendation.ecoRating || 'A' %>) compared to outdated, heavy packaging solutions.
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Recyclability Classification:</strong>
                Categorized under <%= rec.recommendation.recyclingCode %>, ready for modern collection and circular recovery streams.
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Modal Footer -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center">
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double text-emerald-600"></i> Pack-Assist AI Food Science Engine
        </span>
        <button type="button" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition shadow-sm" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
          Done Reading
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- EMBEDDED DATA FOR CLIENT SCRIPTS (Prevents JS linter errors in EJS) -->
<script id="assessmentData" type="application/json">
  <%- JSON.stringify({
    commodityName: rec.commodityName,
    recommendedMaterial: rec.recommendation.recommendedMaterial,
    otr: rec.recommendation.barrierRequirements.otr,
    wvtr: rec.recommendation.barrierRequirements.wvtr,
    thickness: rec.recommendation.structuralSpecs.recommendedThicknessMicrons,
    mapGasRatios: rec.recommendation.mapGasRatios || { co2Pct: 20, o2Pct: 5, n2Pct: 75 },
    tradeoffs: rec.recommendation.tradeoffs || [],
    costIndex: (rec.recommendation.tradeoffs && rec.recommendation.tradeoffs[0] && rec.recommendation.tradeoffs[0].cost_index) || 55,
    packagingType: (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.packagingType) || 'Stand-Up Pouch (Doypack)',
    packagingSize: (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.packagingSize) || 'Retail Standard (250g - 500g)',
    desiredShelfLifeDays: (rec.inputs && rec.inputs.desiredShelfLifeDays) || 30
  }) %>
</script>

<!-- CLIENT SCRIPT FOR CHARTS & ACTIONS -->
<script>
  /* global Chart */
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    // 0. Initialize Dynamic Compatibility & Disposable Progress Bars and Radial Gauge
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-progress]').forEach(function (bar) {
      const val = bar.getAttribute('data-progress');
      if (val) {
        // Trigger a tiny microtask or direct assign for smooth CSS transition
        setTimeout(function () {
          bar.style.width = val + '%';
        }, 50);
      }
    });

    const compatCircle = document.getElementById('compatGaugeCircle');
    if (compatCircle && compatCircle.dataset.dasharray) {
      compatCircle.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', compatCircle.dataset.dasharray + ', 100');
    }

    const dataElem = document.getElementById('assessmentData');
    if (!dataElem) return;

    let payload = {};
    try {
      payload = JSON.parse(dataElem.textContent || '{}');
    } catch (e) {
      console.error('Failed to parse assessment data', e);
      return;
    }

    const tradeoffsData = payload.tradeoffs || [];
    const mapGases = payload.mapGasRatios || { co2Pct: 20, o2Pct: 5, n2Pct: 75 };

    // 1. Copy Specs to Clipboard Handler
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copySpecsBtn');
    if (copyBtn) {
      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        const text = 'Packaging Specification for ' + (payload.commodityName || 'Commodity') +
          ': Material: ' + (payload.recommendedMaterial || 'High Barrier Polymer') +
          ', OTR: ' + (payload.otr || 'N/A') + ' cc/m2/day' +
          ', WVTR: ' + (payload.wvtr || 'N/A') + ' g/m2/day' +
          ', Thickness: ' + (payload.thickness || 'N/A') + ' µm' +
          ', MAP: ' + (mapGases.co2Pct || 0) + '% CO2 / ' + (mapGases.o2Pct || 0) + '% O2 / ' + (mapGases.n2Pct || 0) + '% N2';

        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () {
          const orig = copyBtn.innerHTML;
          copyBtn.innerHTML = '<i class="bi bi-check2 text-emerald-600 me-1.5"></i> Copied!';
          setTimeout(function () {
            copyBtn.innerHTML = orig;
          }, 2000);
        }).catch(function (err) {
          console.error('Clipboard copy failed:', err);
        });
      });
    }

    if (typeof Chart === 'undefined') return;

    // 2. Render MAP Gas Doughnut Chart
    const mapCanvas = document.getElementById('mapGasChart');
    if (mapCanvas) {
      const ctxMap = mapCanvas.getContext('2d');
      new Chart(ctxMap, {
        type: 'doughnut',
        data: {
          labels: ['Carbon Dioxide (% CO₂)', 'Oxygen (% O₂)', 'Nitrogen (% N₂)'],
          datasets: [{
            data: [mapGases.co2Pct, mapGases.o2Pct, mapGases.n2Pct],
            backgroundColor: ['#f43f5e', '#0ea5e9', '#64748b'],
            borderWidth: 2,
            borderColor: '#ffffff'
          }]
        },
        options: {
          responsive: true,
          maintainAspectRatio: false,
          plugins: {
            legend: {
              position: 'bottom',
              labels: {
                boxWidth: 12,
                font: { size: 11 }
              }
            },
            tooltip: {
              callbacks: {
                label: function (context) {
                  return ' ' + context.label + ': ' + context.raw + '%';
                }
              }
            }
          },
          cutout: '68%'
        }
      });
    }

    // 3. Render Trade-Offs Comparison Bar Chart
    const tradeoffsCanvas = document.getElementById('tradeoffsChart');
    if (tradeoffsCanvas && tradeoffsData.length > 0) {
      const labels = tradeoffsData.map(function (t) {
        return t.name.length > 25 ? t.name.substring(0, 25) + '...' : t.name;
      });
      const shelfLifeScores = tradeoffsData.map(function (t) { return t.shelf_life_score; });
      const costIndices = tradeoffsData.map(function (t) { return t.cost_index; });
      const carbonIndices = tradeoffsData.map(function (t) { return t.carbon_index * 20; });

      const ctxTradeoffs = tradeoffsCanvas.getContext('2d');
      new Chart(ctxTradeoffs, {
        type: 'bar',
        data: {
          labels: labels,
          datasets: [
            {
              label: 'Shelf Life Score (0-100)',
              data: shelfLifeScores,
              backgroundColor: '#0284c7',
              borderRadius: 6
            },
            {
              label: 'Relative Cost Index',
              data: costIndices,
              backgroundColor: '#f59e0b',
              borderRadius: 6
            },
            {
              label: 'Carbon Footprint Index (Scaled)',
              data: carbonIndices,
              backgroundColor: '#10b981',
              borderRadius: 6
            }
          ]
        },
        options: {
          responsive: true,
          maintainAspectRatio: false,
          scales: {
            y: {
              beginAtZero: true,
              max: 110,
              grid: { color: '#f1f5f9' },
              ticks: { font: { size: 11 } }
            },
            x: {
              grid: { display: false },
              ticks: { font: { size: 10 } }
            }
          },
          plugins: {
            legend: {
              position: 'top',
              labels: {
                boxWidth: 12,
                font: { size: 11 }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      });
    }

    // -------------------------------------------------------------
    // 4. Packaging Economics & Commercial ROI Calculator Logic
    // -------------------------------------------------------------
    let currentCurrency = 'INR';
    const exchangeRateUSD = 85.0;

    const sliderBatch = document.getElementById('sliderBatchSize');
    const dispBatch = document.getElementById('dispBatchSize');
    const inputRetail = document.getElementById('inputRetailPrice');
    const sliderBaseSpoilage = document.getElementById('sliderBaselineSpoilage');
    const dispBaseSpoilage = document.getElementById('dispBaselineSpoilage');
    const sliderAiSpoilage = document.getElementById('sliderAiSpoilage');
    const dispAiSpoilage = document.getElementById('dispAiSpoilage');
    const btnINR = document.getElementById('btnCurrencyINR');
    const btnUSD = document.getElementById('btnCurrencyUSD');
    const currencySymbol = document.getElementById('currencySymbolPrefix');

    const kpiUnitCost = document.getElementById('kpiUnitCost');
    const kpiTotalPackagingCost = document.getElementById('kpiTotalPackagingCost');
    const kpiSavedSpoilage = document.getElementById('kpiSavedSpoilage');
    const kpiNetRoi = document.getElementById('kpiNetRoi');
    const kpiNetGain = document.getElementById('kpiNetGain');
    const kpiPackagingPct = document.getElementById('kpiPackagingPct');
    const kpiSavedUnits = document.getElementById('kpiSavedUnits');
    const badgeScaleDiscount = document.getElementById('badgeScaleDiscount');
    const badgeRoiMultiple = document.getElementById('badgeRoiMultiple');
    const dispWasteReductionPct = document.getElementById('dispWasteReductionPct');
    const barPackagingCost = document.getElementById('barPackagingCost');
    const barNetSavings = document.getElementById('barNetSavings');
    const pctPackagingShare = document.getElementById('pctPackagingShare');
    const pctSavingsShare = document.getElementById('pctSavingsShare');
    const textVerdictSummary = document.getElementById('textVerdictSummary');
    const textCarbonDividend = document.getElementById('textCarbonDividend');

    const costIndex = payload.costIndex || 55;
    const thickness = payload.thickness || 45;
    const packagingType = payload.packagingType || 'Stand-Up Pouch (Doypack)';
    const packagingSize = payload.packagingSize || 'Retail Standard (250g - 500g)';
    const recommendedMaterial = payload.recommendedMaterial || 'High-Barrier Polymer Film';

    function formatCurrency(amount, currency) {
      if (currency === 'INR') {
        return '₹' + Math.round(amount).toLocaleString('en-IN');
      } else {
        return '$' + (amount < 10 ? amount.toFixed(2) : Math.round(amount).toLocaleString('en-US'));
      }
    }

    function calculateEconomics() {
      if (!sliderBatch || !inputRetail) return;

      const batchSize = parseInt(sliderBatch.value, 10) || 25000;
      let retailPrice = parseFloat(inputRetail.value) || (currentCurrency === 'INR' ? 150 : 2.5);
      const baseSpoilage = parseFloat(sliderBaseSpoilage ? sliderBaseSpoilage.value : 12) || 12.0;
      const aiSpoilage = parseFloat(sliderAiSpoilage ? sliderAiSpoilage.value : 2.5) || 2.5;

      // Update slider display labels
      if (dispBatch) dispBatch.textContent = batchSize.toLocaleString('en-IN') + ' units';
      if (dispBaseSpoilage) dispBaseSpoilage.textContent = baseSpoilage.toFixed(1) + '%';
      if (dispAiSpoilage) dispAiSpoilage.textContent = aiSpoilage.toFixed(1) + '%';

      // 1. Thickness Factor
      const thicknessFactor = thickness / 50.0;

      // 2. Format multiplier
      let formatMultiplier = 1.05;
      if (packagingType.includes('Stand-Up') || packagingType.includes('Doypack')) formatMultiplier = 1.25;
      else if (packagingType.includes('Thermoformed') || packagingType.includes('Tray')) formatMultiplier = 1.35;
      else if (packagingType.includes('Vacuum')) formatMultiplier = 1.20;
      else if (packagingType.includes('Pillow')) formatMultiplier = 0.95;

      // 3. Size multiplier
      let sizeMultiplier = 1.0;
      if (packagingSize.includes('Small') || packagingSize.includes('Single')) sizeMultiplier = 0.70;
      else if (packagingSize.includes('Family')) sizeMultiplier = 1.35;
      else if (packagingSize.includes('Bulk')) sizeMultiplier = 1.85;

      // 4. Batch scale discount
      let scaleDiscount = 1.0;
      let scaleBadgeText = 'Standard Scale';
      if (batchSize >= 200000) {
        scaleDiscount = 0.75;
        scaleBadgeText = '-25% Industrial Scale';
      } else if (batchSize >= 50000) {
        scaleDiscount = 0.82;
        scaleBadgeText = '-18% Regional Scale';
      } else if (batchSize >= 10000) {
        scaleDiscount = 0.90;
        scaleBadgeText = '-10% Commercial Scale';
      } else {
        scaleDiscount = 1.0;
        scaleBadgeText = 'Base Pilot Tier';
      }
      if (badgeScaleDiscount) badgeScaleDiscount.textContent = scaleBadgeText;

      // Base unit cost in INR
      const baseUnitCostINR = (costIndex / 25.0) * 1.15 * (0.6 + 0.4 * thicknessFactor) * formatMultiplier * sizeMultiplier * scaleDiscount;
      
      const unitCost = currentCurrency === 'INR' ? baseUnitCostINR : (baseUnitCostINR / exchangeRateUSD);
      const totalPackagingCost = batchSize * unitCost;

      // Spoilage calculation
      const netSpoilageDiffPct = Math.max(0, baseSpoilage - aiSpoilage);
      const savedUnits = Math.round(batchSize * (netSpoilageDiffPct / 100.0));
      const totalInventoryValue = batchSize * retailPrice;
      const spoilageSavedValue = savedUnits * retailPrice;

      // Net economic benefit
      const netGain = spoilageSavedValue - totalPackagingCost;
      const roiPct = totalPackagingCost > 0 ? Math.round((netGain / totalPackagingCost) * 100) : 0;
      const paybackMultiple = totalPackagingCost > 0 ? (spoilageSavedValue / totalPackagingCost).toFixed(1) : '1.0';

      // Carbon dividend (assuming 0.4kg average pack weight and 2.5 kg CO2e per kg food waste)
      const co2SavedTonnes = ((savedUnits * 0.4 * 2.5) / 1000.0).toFixed(2);

      // Render KPI values
      if (kpiUnitCost) {
        const decimals = currentCurrency === 'INR' ? 2 : 3;
        kpiUnitCost.innerHTML = (currentCurrency === 'INR' ? '₹' : '$') + unitCost.toFixed(decimals) + ' <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400">/ unit</span>';
      }

      if (kpiTotalPackagingCost) {
        kpiTotalPackagingCost.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPackagingCost, currentCurrency);
      }

      if (kpiPackagingPct) {
        const shareOfRevenue = totalInventoryValue > 0 ? ((totalPackagingCost / totalInventoryValue) * 100).toFixed(1) : '2.0';
        kpiPackagingPct.textContent = '~' + shareOfRevenue + '% of total batch retail value';
      }

      if (kpiSavedSpoilage) {
        kpiSavedSpoilage.textContent = formatCurrency(spoilageSavedValue, currentCurrency);
      }

      if (kpiSavedUnits) {
        kpiSavedUnits.textContent = savedUnits.toLocaleString('en-IN') + ' packages saved from waste/returns';
      }

      if (kpiNetRoi) {
        kpiNetRoi.textContent = (roiPct >= 0 ? '+' : '') + roiPct + '%';
        kpiNetRoi.className = 'text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black ' + (roiPct >= 0 ? 'text-sky-700' : 'text-rose-600');
      }

      if (badgeRoiMultiple) {
        badgeRoiMultiple.textContent = paybackMultiple + 'x Payback';
      }

      if (kpiNetGain) {
        kpiNetGain.textContent = formatCurrency(netGain, currentCurrency) + ' net bottom-line gain';
      }

      if (dispWasteReductionPct) {
        dispWasteReductionPct.textContent = netSpoilageDiffPct.toFixed(1) + '% Net Spoilage Avoided';
      }

      // Visual Balance Bar
      const totalFinancialPool = totalPackagingCost + spoilageSavedValue;
      let packShare = 20;
      let saveShare = 80;
      if (totalFinancialPool > 0) {
        packShare = Math.min(90, Math.max(10, Math.round((totalPackagingCost / totalFinancialPool) * 100)));
        saveShare = 100 - packShare;
      }
      if (barPackagingCost) barPackagingCost.style.width = packShare + '%';
      if (barNetSavings) barNetSavings.style.width = saveShare + '%';
      if (pctPackagingShare) pctPackagingShare.textContent = packShare + '%';
      if (pctSavingsShare) pctSavingsShare.textContent = saveShare + '%';

      // Commercial Verdict Banner text
      if (textVerdictSummary) {
        const symbol = currentCurrency === 'INR' ? '₹' : '$';
        textVerdictSummary.innerHTML = 'For every <strong>' + symbol + '1.00</strong> invested in <strong>' +
          recommendedMaterial + '</strong>, your enterprise recovers <strong>' +
          symbol + paybackMultiple + '</strong> in unsellable stock and customer returns, unlocking <strong>' +
          formatCurrency(netGain, currentCurrency) + '</strong> in direct profit margin retention.';
      }

      if (textCarbonDividend) {
        textCarbonDividend.textContent = 'Ecological Dividend: Prevents approx ' + co2SavedTonnes + ' tonnes of embedded food waste CO₂e greenhouse emissions.';
      }
    }

    // Attach listeners
    if (sliderBatch) sliderBatch.addEventListener('input', calculateEconomics);
    if (inputRetail) inputRetail.addEventListener('input', calculateEconomics);
    if (sliderBaseSpoilage) sliderBaseSpoilage.addEventListener('input', calculateEconomics);
    if (sliderAiSpoilage) sliderAiSpoilage.addEventListener('input', calculateEconomics);

    // Batch Presets
    document.querySelectorAll('.btn-batch-preset').forEach(function (btn) {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        document.querySelectorAll('.btn-batch-preset').forEach(function (b) {
          b.className = 'btn-batch-preset px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200';
        });
        btn.className = 'btn-batch-preset px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold bg-amber-600 text-white shadow-2xs';
        if (sliderBatch) sliderBatch.value = btn.getAttribute('data-value');
        calculateEconomics();
      });
    });

    // Currency Switcher
    if (btnINR && btnUSD) {
      btnINR.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (currentCurrency === 'INR') return;
        currentCurrency = 'INR';
        btnINR.className = 'px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm transition';
        btnUSD.className = 'px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 transition';
        if (currencySymbol) currencySymbol.textContent = '₹';
        if (inputRetail) inputRetail.value = Math.round(parseFloat(inputRetail.value) * exchangeRateUSD);
        calculateEconomics();
      });

      btnUSD.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (currentCurrency === 'USD') return;
        currentCurrency = 'USD';
        btnUSD.className = 'px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-900 shadow-sm transition';
        btnINR.className = 'px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 transition';
        if (currencySymbol) currencySymbol.textContent = '$';
        if (inputRetail) inputRetail.value = (parseFloat(inputRetail.value) / exchangeRateUSD).toFixed(2);
        calculateEconomics();
      });
    }

    // Initialize economics calculator on load
    calculateEconomics();
  });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
